Additional Notices
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Scope. These terms cover everything in this repository, in every format: the
source code, and the LiteRT, ONNX, and JAX/Keras weights, together with any
TensorRT, TensorFlow, or other artifact built from them. The Privacy Protection
Addendum applies to all of them without exception. Compiling the model for a
server-side or cloud runtime does not remove the local-processing requirement.

Relationship to open-rppg. The licensing notice in KegangWangCCNU/open-rppg
defers the terms of pretrained models to their original authors. For the
FacePhys model, this file is that statement of terms, and it governs the FacePhys
weights wherever they are obtained.

Training data. FacePhys was trained on the RLAP dataset, which is licensed
separately under CC BY-NC-ND 4.0 and requires a signed Data Usage Agreement.
Nothing in this license grants any right to the RLAP dataset itself.
See https://github.com/KegangWangCCNU/RLAP-dataset

Not a medical device. FacePhys is a research model. It is not a medical device
and is not intended for the diagnosis, cure, mitigation, treatment, or
prevention of any disease or condition. If you deploy it in a product that makes
health or medical claims, you are solely responsible for your own regulatory
compliance (for example FDA, CE/MDR, or NMPA). The Software is provided without
warranty of any kind.

Citation. If you use FacePhys in academic work, please cite the FacePhys paper
linked in the README.
